EduBot Alembic Migrations
=========================

## Setup (first time)

1. Install dependencies:
   pip install alembic psycopg2-binary

2. Set DATABASE_URL in Backend/.env:
   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/edubot

3. Generate the initial migration from your SQLModel models:
   cd Backend
   alembic revision --autogenerate -m "initial schema"

4. Apply the migration:
   alembic upgrade head

## Common commands

  alembic upgrade head          — apply all pending migrations
  alembic downgrade -1          — roll back one migration
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add column x"  — generate a new migration
  alembic history               — show migration history
  alembic current               — show current DB revision
